WEBVTT

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.850
Hurry! Hurry up and call the AD Police!

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.370
I can't stop the boomer!

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:13.090
Priss, you're late!

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:17.900
A boomer in a factory in the 11th
district is on a rampage.

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:21.500
A dispatch request has already
been sent to the AD Police.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.800
This might be troublesome,

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:27.040
because the mad boomer is fusing
with nearby machines.

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:30.180
Hurry!

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:52.370
The scene inside is very bad.
Send in a probe robot.

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:53.360
Roger!

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:04.940
Wow, this place has already
become a big show.

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:10.180
I guess this has nothing to do with us.

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:12.020
Why don't we sit back and watch?

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:18.490
Geez, you're so faithful to your job.

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:21.190
It looks like the AD Police
are declaring all out war.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:24.320
Priss!

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:28.000
Is this boomer strong?

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.300
If it starts to fuse with the machines
around it, it'll be tough.

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:38.030
Linna, hurry up!

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:51.120
Knight Sabers, action!

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:30.030
Is it okay to let the AD Police start first?

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:33.430
The goal is to capture the Knight Sabers.

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:38.340
Many members of the AD Police
harbor hostility towards them.

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:42.640
So I'm going to use them.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:48.810
It's possible to make a boomer go
berserk on purpose, isn't it?

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:53.720
No, it's impossible.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:56.520
The process whereby a boomer
descends into madness

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:59.890
has not been analyzed yet,
even at our laboratory.

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:05.200
I see! But the one now acting
violent over there is...

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:11.870
We saved the core from a boomer
that previously went berserk.

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:13.810
We transplanted it into that one.

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:17.510
I see.

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:21.170
I wonder if our iron ladies will show or not?

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:26.650
When you capture the Knight Sabers,
what are you going to do?

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:34.020
I'd like to have a nice dinner
together and hear their story.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.550
There it is!

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:52.840
That monster!

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:01.920
Damn! It fused with the probe robot.

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:06.460
Yamaguchi team, storm the place!
Assume there are no survivors!

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:09.190
Roger! Please put the K-suits on alert!

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:15.630
Go!

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:25.110
Uh-oh, they're storming the place.

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:29.580
The boomer's feeding off the
factory's power supply.

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:30.720
Nene!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.350
I understand!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:35.960
But the first thing is to smash the
AD Police's spy camera.

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:36.950
Later!

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:41.630
Now, we'll go in from behind! Right?

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:44.000
Please don't get in my way.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:47.020
I don't think I'll be an amateur for long!

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:53.910
Here come the Knight Sabers!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:54.930
Finally!

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:00.480
Damn! What's wrong?

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.040
You can't peek at us!

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.850
The view has been switched
to a boomer's camera.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:22.360
I just want to ask them a question.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:30.310
Why do they hate boomers?
Why can't they love boomers?

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:36.150
Some humans become insane.

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:40.320
Why is it only boomers incite such fury?

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:42.990
Only when these ladies love boomers

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:47.150
can boomers live together with
humans as a sub-human race.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:51.870
Don't you think so?

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:56.500
I wonder if boomers can coexist
with human beings?

00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:01.200
I see! You don't like boomers, do you, Mason?

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.510
I'll leave the rest of this incident
to the AD Police.

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:07.780
If you'll excuse me?

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:15.420
I want you to love boomers, ladies.

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:22.180
Who? Who do you think brought
this Megalocity back to life?!

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:26.390
Respect the boomers!

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:47.480
Rosencroitz asked me

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:52.320
if I hate boomers.

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:55.780
You do hate boomers, don't you,
Mr. Vice President?

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.120
Of course I hate them.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:08.260
But don't misunderstand. I didn't mean you.

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:14.270
The reason I kiss that zombie's ass
is because I like boomers.

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:19.640
But I don't mean ordinary boomers.

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:23.270
I'm seeking

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:25.880
my own boomer.

00:09:51.850 --> 00:09:54.310
What am I doing?

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:02.560
The earthquake damage in the
Tokyo area is tremendous,

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:05.680
and the city center seems to be
almost completely destroyed.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:13.300
Miss Sylia, I've just had a call from
Bioscape headquarters.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:17.930
Dr. Stingray... Your father is
missing in the earthquake.

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:21.510
I'm sorry.

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:24.640
I've been thinking that it might
be good if he dies.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.380
Miss Sylia!

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:29.470
I'm sure that Mama called him.

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:33.820
I don't care if you need to use a cable!

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:36.860
Establish a circuit between
us and the team inside!

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:39.620
Damn! We might have to give
up the rest of the plan.

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:45.300
Hey, I thought you were off today, Leon.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.670
You're going overboard, aren't you?

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:50.340
I've heard this incident will be on the air,

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:53.540
so we can show the citizens that
the AD Police can be trusted.

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:54.840
A circuit hasn't been established yet?!

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:55.980
It's about to connect!

00:10:55.980 --> 00:11:00.280
It's staged? I don't like things like this.

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:01.680
It's strange.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:05.890
I know the top brass wouldn't give permission

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:08.720
to show the AD Police's operations
or equipment to the news media.

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:11.290
Settling this is a long way off.

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:13.020
What do you mean by that?

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:41.250
Dispatch the K-suits! Our weapons
don't work against it at all!

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:49.160
I can't believe they're going
to use that useless thing.

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:51.730
I wonder if they want to die?

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:52.700
Die?!

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.700
Nene, finished yet?

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:02.100
Anybody could do this job if it was
just cutting the electricity!

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:06.880
Wait a second, I'm almost finished.

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:08.580
Hurry up!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.450
Sylia, I'm going in!

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:13.120
Sylia!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:15.720
Priss, what's the current situation?

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:19.730
They're withdrawing the first team
and bringing out the K-suits.

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:22.350
Okay. Hit and away!

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.620
Since this is such a circus,

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:45.210
I didn't believe the Knight Sabers would come.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.440
The K-suits!

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.410
Get out of my way! I'm going to finish it!

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.970
There are some noisy guys here.

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:20.650
Nene, haven't you finished yet?

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.250
I haven't done anything like this in a while.

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:27.860
Don't fool around, kid!

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:30.530
How rude!

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:32.290
This way here, and...

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.580
Good! I can do it!

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:44.910
It's no good! That boomer is...

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:55.590
Hurry up and get out!

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:58.020
That boomer wants to combine with the K-suit!

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:04.660
Now, I'm done!

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.030
Priss, are you ready?

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.430
You're slow.

00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:10.900
Who the hell do you think you are?

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:13.560
Switch on!

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:38.700
You did it, Nene.

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:41.430
Incredible! The boomer is
becoming smaller and smaller.

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:42.560
Let's go.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:48.500
They're here all right!

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:57.540
Ladies, I've been waiting for you.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.660
She changed the phase on the electrical current

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:04.450
and stopped the boomer from getting bigger.

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:06.960
Here it comes!

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.260
Linna!

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.770
Damn!

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.570
We need to hurry up, or this thing
will get saturated and explode!

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:29.880
Nene!

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:33.390
I did it! Now you know I can do it!

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:36.690
Nene, hurry up and smash the core!

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:38.750
I know that!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.230
What an ugly monster!

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:54.740
What is Papa making?

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:58.010
A semi-human.

00:15:58.010 --> 00:16:00.610
What's a semi-human?

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:04.720
I've heard it means a thing that
can substitute for human beings.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:08.190
Wow! Papa's incredible, isn't he?

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:12.360
Really? I don't know about that.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:17.030
I wonder if what he's doing
is betraying God's will.

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:20.970
Even so, do you still think he's incredible, Sylia?

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:22.600
Why?!

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:23.570
Mama?

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.310
Papa...

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:42.980
Linna!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:47.420
What perfect powered suits they wear!

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:51.560
I'm going to attack it first!

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:07.310
I'm sorry, but please leave now.

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:09.020
You're saying I have to go home?!

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:11.320
Are you saying he doesn't want
to see his wife at all?!

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:15.080
His work is more important
than his family, is it?!

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:19.890
No matter what we do, rejection
symptoms appear in the subject.

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:24.160
I think you understand what I mean.

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:29.470
Of course they do! Because you're
doing things against God's will.

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:34.070
Come here, Sylia! Papa is saying
that he doesn't need you anymore.

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:36.410
The Doctor never said anything like that!

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:39.780
Let's go, Sylia!

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:40.970
Papa!

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.760
Papa...

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:53.620
Why me?

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:59.200
Mama... Mama is...

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:02.100
Mama's been sick.

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:07.270
She hadn't been the same person
she was for a long time.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:10.740
From now on, Papa will take good care of you.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:11.950
Papa...

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:14.940
That's right. I'll tell you what
we'll do from now on.

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.540
I have a favor to ask of you, Sylia.

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:23.720
I want you to help me with my work.

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:25.930
What do I need to do?

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:28.390
You don't need to do anything.

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:31.520
You'll just sleep for a short while.

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:36.000
You trust your Papa, don't you?

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:40.100
You love your Papa, don't you?

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:43.400
You'll help me, won't you?

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:51.680
Good! Now I can give life to the boomer.

00:18:58.420 --> 00:18:59.790
Linna!

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:01.230
Thanks!

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:03.130
Our meters are getting very close to the limit.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.970
Nene and I will keep the boomer
from moving around.

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:10.870
You smash the core!

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:11.840
I understand!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:35.190
Smash the core!

00:19:58.350 --> 00:19:59.820
I did it.

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:02.590
Linna! Hey, Linna!

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.250
Our meters are almost expired. Let's go!

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:16.240
What the hell? What the hell are they doing?!

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:17.670
Are they going to kill them?

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:25.510
Don't hit them. This is just a threat.

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:27.580
Don't let the Knight Sabers go!

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:31.920
I guess that was the main purpose
of the dispatch this time.

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:34.190
I understand now.

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:36.210
Why are they aiming at us?!

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:45.530
Linna!

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:53.830
Linna!

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:59.230
Next Episode

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.770
The AD Police press the attack.

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:07.340
Priss, Linna and Nene are cornered!

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:11.250
Apparently, we've been their
target from the beginning.

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:14.150
Oh, no! The battery meters
have reached their limit!

00:21:14.150 --> 00:21:16.520
If this goes on, Priss and others will be...

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:19.950
Now there's no other choice but
for me to go out there!

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:22.420
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
